---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure"
  description="How affiliate links on Light work and how they are disclosed."
>
  <article class="prose prose-neutral">
    <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
    <p>
      Light earns money through affiliate programs. When you click certain links on this site and
      make a purchase, we may receive a commission from the merchant. You pay the same price either
      way.
    </p>

    <h2>What this means for you</h2>
    <p>
      Affiliate income never decides which product we recommend. We choose the pick first, then add
      a link to it. If a product stops being worth your money, we update or remove the recommendation.
    </p>

    <h2>How we mark affiliate links</h2>
    <p>
      Affiliate links are marked with a <code>rel="sponsored"</code> attribute and any article that
      contains them shows a short disclosure near the top.
    </p>

    <h2>Programs we participate in</h2>
    <p>
      We participate in affiliate programs such as Amazon Associates, Impact, and PartnerStack, and
      may add others over time. As an Amazon Associate we earn from qualifying purchases.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
